    "detailed_description": "Animal Kostume is a hardcore 2D platformer where you take the position of kroc-boy, a dude dressed up in a crocodile suit who must overcome ten levels packed with enemies in order to finish his turn in the Animal Kostume night. Expect a lot of tries to finish this challenging adventure and find out a bit more about the future of the Animal Kostume group!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt; Main features:<br />\r\n- 10 levels with increasing difficulty;<br />\r\n- Drop-items (surprises) that might either boost your number and quantity of bullets or health;<br />\r\n- Retro/old school style;<br />\r\n- Double jump;<br />\r\n- Short game but with very high difficulty;<br />\r\n- Two types of guns: normal rifle and rpg;<br />\r\n- HP system and no continues.",
